{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "1ea7f23bce972cd04b57e131a08f626c5b6ca8045367fe3b525c264d0cdae184", "ja": "あの月のように", "zh": "就像那明月般", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "01f75d8a18d3ba0c8b5766b8846679ccd6a261d019ecb5e48af94ecbdead5ca7", "ja": "公演を翌日に控え、屋上に集まった5人は、\n月を見上げながらこれまでの練習を振り\n返る。それぞれの『月らしさ』を見つけたメ\nンバー達は、天に浮かぶ月のように輝き、\n最高のステージを作ることを誓うのだった。", "zh": "五位偶像在公演前一天到屋顶上集合，\n她们仰望明月，回顾这段日子的练习。\n她们各自找到属于自己的『月亮印象』，\n并宣誓将会像高挂天际的明月般闪耀，\n带来最棒的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "258d782f59c396f2a36846b535adc4ffa96c0bd51bf8c6353dbab70970664283", "ja": "（明日は『BlueMoon Harmony!』公演だ。\n今日のリハは、申し分ない仕上がりだった！）", "zh": "（明天就是『BlueMoon Harmony!』公演了。\n今天的排演成果可说是无可挑剔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "056c82d380cd8a9a5ac4e0a8ab168ff4617dd273db6512cc0cb731914895e19a", "ja": "（そして、本番に向けて月の下で気合いを入れよう！\nという麗花の発案で、屋上へ上がってきた）", "zh": "（然后，丽花提议大家在月光下为正式演出做精神喊话，\n于是我们来到屋顶。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "10cc3b8ef078edb456b5cfb2d33969fdcbad470ad25803ec5cfa020dab21bc11", "ja": "おおーっ♪　ちゃんと月が出てますよっ。\n絶好の「えいえいおー」日和ですね♪", "zh": "喔喔──♪月亮有出来呢！\n风和日丽，非常适合精神喊话呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "fc21abb1472a6beb66057493c6959cc05ebe227da4ba3dda0b3010c6177b0eb8", "ja": "そ、そうですね。\n日和って、言っていいのかな……。", "zh": "是、是啊。\n现在应该讲风和日丽吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "fba6a5891bf2330bd4fbdbe08cc1a1e275b65db328039581de308ee75b456a3f", "ja": "でも、月の下で気合いを入れるなんて、\n私達にピッタリじゃないかな？", "zh": "不过，在月亮下精神喊话，\n不是很适合我们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "34ec5af70a25170c126cc5203b205149ea1aeb59caa7c9725807b69d15f4ea69", "ja": "はい。より大きく輝くために、みんなの力を合わせる。\n……それが科学館で見つけた、月のイメージですから。", "zh": "是的，为了绽放更大的光芒，大家要同心协力。\n……这就是我在科学馆发现的月亮印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "4937d232062f78f3088d883f44fb81804952629134165d845d3bd861b45a4309", "ja": "えっ、科学館にそんなこと書いてあったの？\n静香ちゃん、よく見つけたね。えらいえらい♪", "zh": "什么！？科学馆有这样写吗？\n静香，真亏你能发现，好棒喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "b9497bf45483ddee17bd87066f5b4f650aaae24be586723e7a775714d5a52efd", "ja": "いえ、科学館というか……\n麗花さんに教わったようなものだと思います。", "zh": "不，与其说是科学馆……\n这比较像是丽花姊让我领悟到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "ae87353ee2289d370ffce4eaf4f1804ee012ebbf2d48d03f1e0da77b4440a47d", "ja": "うーん……？　でも、静香ちゃんが感じたことは、\n静香ちゃんのおかげでいいと思うな♪", "zh": "唔……？不过，既然是静香自己的感受，\n那我觉得就是静香自己的功劳啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "257ea181122753bcb28cb28ded68691d63a911fc282115edd3705c1bf60becda", "ja": "……ふふっ、わかりました。\nじゃあ、そう思うことにしますね。", "zh": "……呵呵，好吧。\n那我就恭敬不如从命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "5d004ede91a9bf63313f1d9b1a30f3baf8af2046eedef986ae054321aa674233", "ja": "私も、麗花さんや静香ちゃん、みんなに遅れない\nように。しっかりついて行くからね！", "zh": "丽花姊、静香，我也不会落后你们大家。\n我会紧追在后的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e1d2a4d973555259f93c0d4befd3cebd6a5212ad8b1039415e512f07af6d99f9", "ja": "月らしさ、かあ。アタシはやっぱ、\n朋花にいろいろ教えられたかな！", "zh": "月亮的印象，是吗？\n感觉我真的从朋花身上学到很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "799021cea44fe34cb68997feae0849c72f3a2530a760652af0b29d36ea02e8f0", "ja": "朋花自身もファンのために、毎日バリバリ努力してさ。\nアタシも負けてらんないよ。", "zh": "朋花自己也为了粉丝们每天努力练习。\n我也不能输给她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "539c6b5487117b921dc6e20265f273ff807687b582eae65cf21b731e24c387e4", "ja": "負けていられないのは私の方です。それに、努力を\n怠らないことは、聖母として当然の務めですから～。", "zh": "不能输的是我。\n而且，努力不倦怠，这本来就是圣母的职责～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "8d49b71652a9c1a32f089e2686b1765bcc0212735dc7b2fcd421d8e81edc1aee", "ja": "私は……いえ、私達は、夜を照らし人々を導く月。\nそして……。", "zh": "我是……不，我们是照亮夜空、引导众人的明月。\n同时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3fabc5d6bde91d7ccddadf237b61d14a70b80b0eac9609ea3bc4ac138e20e679", "ja": "そしてファンのみんなも、アタシたちを\n照らしてくれる光、だよな！", "zh": "同时粉丝们也是照耀我们的光芒，\n没错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "17d75c0b5b7c19cce93bbeb8f8dd627b5041bd7641769496c2c2bdb88f765f8e", "ja": "はい。地上の子豚ちゃん達が放つ光を集め、\n私達は何者よりも輝く月となるのです～。", "zh": "没错，我们会聚集地面上的小猪们绽放的光芒，\n成为最为闪耀的明月～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "207bcbb3510ec71c1e9b994d0e5a89a2af7df918d56238739c590af7c9dcd051", "ja": "……今回は、みんな練習を通して、\nそれぞれの月を見つけられた、って感じだな！", "zh": "……看来这次大家在练习中，\n都有找到属于自己的月亮呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "97c9835e1546b16e6d83a3452fdb907f84bd0f4044a04f8e594e67798f24d109", "ja": "あれっ？　……はい、はーい！\n私、特に何も見つけてないと思います！", "zh": "咦……我！我有意见──！\n我好像没有找到什么东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e56bb1a8f7d8ab446fe58fc9a6b9d51836087bbbb6e54a5ab088f86771088625", "ja": "はっ、そういえば……！　いや、でも麗花は、\n見つけるまでもないかも知れないぞ？", "zh": "啊！这么说的话……！\n不对，丽花应该不需要去找吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "a648877cac391b2bbac35639a30c3d32cfe08d2fc4fa8b1b8b9083a24dc63c42", "ja": "麗花さんは、この中の誰よりも\n月らしい人ですからね～。", "zh": "因为丽花姊是我们之中\n最像月亮的人啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9f48d62d93a5941dbe8468eaf2e5b82c26e0874b7f8966f2dc0064ac78cd3192", "ja": "あ、朋花が最初に言ってた\n月のイメージのことだよな？", "zh": "啊，是朋花最一开始说的月亮印象，\n对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "e657159cc734cf8f610c473e33ea6471a32f639c7adc1fb0bfe7154b3a544f43", "ja": "美しすぎる月の光は、人の心を惑わす……\nでしたっけ。", "zh": "太过美丽的月光会迷惑人心……\n是这个没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "5dc878920185b07e04fb560357c21704375a9fd5b69ef50c5e4fdb2d3f8f68ed", "ja": "そうですね。魅惑的で、自然に惹きつけられて、\n目が離せなくなる……そんな人ですから。", "zh": "没错，充满魅力，会让人自然地受到吸引，\n无法移开视线……丽花姊就是这样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "313e8950c7972fc443b1f3ea380cdac6de944a53c5340dad21484748118ee09b", "ja": "わあ……えへへっ、なんだかうれしいな♪\nそれじゃ……。", "zh": "哇……嘿嘿！我觉得好开心喔♪\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "3a3cc19b25b64977881c01976c592de2adf038791c8330671dcb262eabdd659a", "ja": "そんなみんなに、ありがとうのぎゅーっ♪", "zh": "大家这么称赞我，给大家感谢的抱抱──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "7da11cfef637121c0442909bc0b72462dcaebbc2e2b4f68a2f0439b9d665a069", "ja": "んぷっ。れ、麗花さん、息が……！", "zh": "嗯噗！丽、丽花姊，我要窒息了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "7be92be6655245542db4364dc83cbb0d12c411d0161e208689a94549a73a0edd", "ja": "んっ。うふふ、くすぐったいです～。", "zh": "唔，呵呵，好痒喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "59b59385d57dcb601905fdf4f50e098eac8f3679c361fb025c2e97e9b3c32dfb", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、ぎゅーっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是，抱抱──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e36008fb9a71f1bcd33aa2aed0a7dec7fbee0b0704acfa1304f2f8d0ca3732b1", "ja": "うわぁっ、なんで俺まで……っぷ！", "zh": "哇！为什么连我也有份……噗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "026261031b944c9670be46a35ccb5803a22d0815843b38b3112a5bac0b7f685f", "ja": "では……。そろそろ夜も更けて来ましたし、\n誓いを交わすとしましょうか～。", "zh": "那么……夜也深了，\n差不多该来宣誓了吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_06_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "4653d50ebfa95499d00c426c28e4b2caedc478fe86901b327a4b4d9d411b9a82", "ja": "明日の公演では、夜空に浮かぶあの月のように輝き\n人々に光を届けるといたしましょう～。", "zh": "明天的公演，我们要像那夜空中高挂的明月般闪耀，\n用月光照耀众人～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
